- goal: The wildcard-subscribe bus primitive (`subscribe_pattern`, trailing-glob prefix) as a transport-agnostic contract, filtered natively per transport (in-process registry / MQTT broker wildcard / **CAN hardware acceptance mask**). Underpins Flow pattern subscription + Headless bus-triggering.
- spec: **[SPEC:CXC-PATSUB]** (`21-composebus-pattern-subscription.lts`, 2026-07-07) — CAN hierarchical-ID encoding + ESP32-TWAI + graceful HW-filter-bank fallback baked in.
